WEBVTT

00:00:24.284 --> 00:00:25.981
Harry?

00:00:25.981 --> 00:00:26.982
Ron...

00:00:28.418 --> 00:00:31.160
Bloody hell.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:34.163
We still sound like ourselves.

00:00:34.163 --> 00:00:36.165
You need to sound
more like Crabbe.

00:00:36.165 --> 00:00:38.428
[DEEPLY]
Bloody hell.

00:00:38.428 --> 00:00:39.603
Excellent.

00:00:39.603 --> 00:00:42.171
But where's Hermione?

00:00:42.171 --> 00:00:43.868
HERMIONE:
I-- I don't think I'm going.

00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:46.088
You go on
without me.

00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:47.524
Hermione, are you okay?

00:00:47.524 --> 00:00:50.440
Just go!
You're wasting time.

00:00:52.268 --> 00:00:54.879
Come on.

00:00:57.578 --> 00:00:59.754
I think the Slytherin
common room's this way.

00:00:59.754 --> 00:01:01.190
Okay.

00:01:02.887 --> 00:01:04.933
Excuse me?

00:01:08.197 --> 00:01:10.417
What are you doing do--?

00:01:10.417 --> 00:01:12.462
[DEEPLY] I mean, what are you
doing down here?

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:17.467
I happen to be a school prefect.

00:01:17.467 --> 00:01:19.252
You, on the other hand,
have no business

00:01:19.252 --> 00:01:21.819
wandering the corridors
at this time of night.

00:01:21.819 --> 00:01:23.299
What are your names again?

00:01:23.299 --> 00:01:24.605
Uh...

00:01:24.605 --> 00:01:26.346
I'm--

00:01:26.346 --> 00:01:28.783
Crabbe, Goyle,
where have you two been?

00:01:28.783 --> 00:01:32.308
Pigging out in the Great Hall
all this time?

00:01:32.308 --> 00:01:34.528
Why are you wearing glasses?

00:01:34.528 --> 00:01:37.008
Ah...um...reading.

00:01:37.008 --> 00:01:40.142
Reading?

00:01:40.142 --> 00:01:42.449
I didn't know
you could read.

00:01:45.626 --> 00:01:47.845
And what are you doing
down here, Weasley?

00:01:47.845 --> 00:01:49.630
Mind your attitude,
Malfoy.

00:01:57.812 --> 00:02:01.337
Well, sit down.

00:02:01.337 --> 00:02:02.860
You'd never know

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:04.819
the Weasleys
were pure-bloods,

00:02:04.819 --> 00:02:07.169
the way they behave.

00:02:07.169 --> 00:02:09.084
They're an embarrassment
to the wizarding world.

00:02:09.084 --> 00:02:10.085
All of them.

00:02:12.435 --> 00:02:13.958
What's wrong with you, Crabbe?

00:02:16.265 --> 00:02:18.180
Stomachache.

00:02:20.051 --> 00:02:22.402
You know, I'm surprised
that the Daily Prophet

00:02:22.402 --> 00:02:25.056
hasn't done a report
on all these attacks.

00:02:25.056 --> 00:02:27.755
I suppose Dumbledore
is trying to hush it all up.

00:02:27.755 --> 00:02:29.800
Father always said
that Dumbledore was

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:31.889
the worst thing that
ever happened to this place.

00:02:31.889 --> 00:02:33.021
You're wrong!

00:02:40.376 --> 00:02:42.335
What?

00:02:42.335 --> 00:02:45.599
You think there's someone here
who's worse than Dumbledore?

00:02:46.861 --> 00:02:49.385
Well, do you?

00:02:49.385 --> 00:02:50.952
Harry Potter?

00:02:58.133 --> 00:02:59.439
Good one, Goyle.

00:02:59.439 --> 00:03:01.571
You're absolutely right.

00:03:01.571 --> 00:03:04.095
Saint Potter.

00:03:04.095 --> 00:03:06.402
And people
actually think

00:03:06.402 --> 00:03:07.838
that he's the Heir of Slytherin?

00:03:11.451 --> 00:03:13.844
But then you must have some idea
who's behind it all.

00:03:13.844 --> 00:03:18.806
You know I don't, Goyle.
I told you yesterday.

00:03:18.806 --> 00:03:21.591
How many times
do I have to tell you?

00:03:21.591 --> 00:03:23.071
Is this yours?

00:03:28.598 --> 00:03:31.297
But my father
did say this:

00:03:31.297 --> 00:03:34.865
It's been 50 years
since the Chamber was opened.

00:03:34.865 --> 00:03:36.606
He wouldn't tell me
who opened it,

00:03:36.606 --> 00:03:37.912
only that they were expelled.

00:03:39.174 --> 00:03:40.393
The last time

00:03:40.393 --> 00:03:42.003
the Chamber of Secrets
was opened,

00:03:42.003 --> 00:03:44.397
a Mudblood died...

00:03:44.397 --> 00:03:46.007
so it's only a matter of time

00:03:46.007 --> 00:03:48.879
before one of them
is killed this time.

00:03:48.879 --> 00:03:52.187
As for me, I hope it's Granger.

00:03:53.623 --> 00:03:55.625
What's the matter with you two?

00:03:55.625 --> 00:03:56.800
You're acting very...

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.454
odd.

00:03:58.454 --> 00:03:59.934
It's his stomachache.

00:03:59.934 --> 00:04:01.240
Calm down.

00:04:06.854 --> 00:04:08.247
[WHISPERING]
Scar.

00:04:12.555 --> 00:04:14.905
Hair.

